  "display_title": "Wedding Plans for Mr. & Mr.",
  "description": "Gyeong-Won Yu is a successful wedding planner. Though excellent at planning other people’s weddings, he’s terrible at planning his own love life and is always falling for the groom. This rings true when his one-night stand, the handsome Gang-U Seo, becomes his new client. Despite their unexpectedly hot first meeting and their endless magnetic attraction, Gyeong-Won now needs to plan Gang-U's wedding. Can Gyeong-Won keep his cool to design the perfect wedding? Or will he succumb to the groom’s lustful advances? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
